{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890270/extras/31c4c5dc1bcfa90a76ea297842b32e17.avif?t=1767213270\" width=616 height=180 /></span><br>In the Augment Battle System, each fighter can act twice per turn. Use your first move to cast spells or attacks, and use your second move to modify those commands with game-changing Augments!<br><br>Augments apply diverse modifiers to your arsenal: Imbue attacks with lightning damage, cast your heals as team-wide spells, and guarantee your buffs trigger before anyone else moves. With millions of Primary-Augment combos available in-game, the sky\u2019s the limit!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890270/extras/66588fdbdb6bb05b8e40283a57c42f44.avif?t=1767213270\" width=616 height=180 /></span><br>Trailthread's story follows a blacksmith, baker, and bandit on their journey to scale Anvite Mountain and slay the bitter Obsidian Drake. Rekindle enchanted forges, meet strange friends, and tumble across the timeline with the mysterious Timestitcher. Can you reach the summit?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890270/extras/91c35813180699105ca1abcab7ef5415.avif?t=1767213270\" width=616 height=180 /></span><br>Trailthread is a focused 10-hour experience. It features a streamlined world map and quick combat expansion. Enjoy plenty of strategic customization, expressive characters, vibrant music, and more\u2026 all in one tight-knit package!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1890270?t=1767213270","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1890270?t=1767213270","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890270/capsule_23